  "body": "## What changed\n\nRemove the remaining review folders for PRs #1744, #1699, #1710, and #1724.\nRemove the optional boundary screenshot hook.\nSend manual PR #1710 captures to the operating system temporary directory, under `camcraft-review-1710`.\nRecord why PR #1724 evidence no longer stays in the product tree.\nPreserve access to the old evidence through Git history and PR links.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe earlier cleanup listed only four other folders.\nThe PR #1724 retention decision used those folders as its precedent.\nCapture helpers could recreate review folders in the product tree.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll three pins failed before the fix and passed after it:\n\n- `reviewed_screenshot_directories_are_absent`\n- `boundary_test_has_no_review_capture_hook`\n- `manual_review_capture_uses_scratch_directory`\n\nEach of six mutations failed independently, then passed after restoration:\n\n- Restore the PR #1744 folder from upstream/main.\n- Restore the PR #1699 folder from upstream/main.\n- Restore the PR #1710 folder from upstream/main.\n- Restore the PR #1724 folder from upstream/main.\n- Restore the old boundary capture source from upstream/main.\n- Restore the old manual capture source from upstream/main.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed.\n`cargo clippy -p xtask -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe source checks pin the capture policy without rendering new screenshots.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. No `.nc`, `.cl`, or snapshot golden changed.\nThe 14 removed PNGs are review evidence.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe ignored manual GPU capture test was not run.\nNo new screenshots were captured or uploaded.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changed a planned file during the overlap check.\nThis branch starts from upstream/main at `62e1d36a`.\n\nEffort: low\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: Remove remaining committed PR review artifacts and prevent capture helpers from recreating them in the product tree.\n\nFixes #1845\n",
